{"id":"9632867116303951","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryTypeRow.md","title":"CurryTypeRow","display":"CurryTypeRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CurryTypeRow","parameters":["z1726","z1727","z1728"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CurryTypeRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1726</span><span>z1727</span><span>z1728</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>z1726</code>、<code>z1727</code>、<code>z1728</code>。</p>\n<p>独立的 Curry 简单类型指派规则；抽象参数类型不由检查器定义。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CurryTypeRow z1726 z1727 z1728)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists g\n  (exists t\n    (exists a\n      (and\n        (exists z1731 (and (@ Pair t a z1731) (@ Pair g z1731 z1728)))\n        (exists z1732\n          (and\n            (@ Omega z1732)\n            (and\n              (@ STCtx z1732 g)\n              (and\n                (@ STTy z1732 a)\n                (and\n                  (@ URaw t)\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1733 (and (@ TVar z1733 t) (@ App g z1733 a)))\n                    (or\n                      (exists z1734\n                        (exists z1735\n                          (exists z1736\n                            (exists z1737\n                            (and\n                            (@ ULam z1735 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ TArr z1734 z1736 a)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Cons z1734 g z1737)\n                            (exists z1741\n                            (exists z1742\n                            (and\n                            (in z1741 z1727)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1726 z1741 z1742)\n                            (exists z1743 (and (@ Pair z1735 z1736 z1743) (@ Pair z1737 z1743 z1742))))))))))))))\n                      (exists z1738\n                        (exists z1739\n                          (exists z1734\n                            (exists z1740\n                            (and\n                            (@ TApp z1738 z1739 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ TArr z1734 a z1740)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1744\n                            (exists z1745\n                            (and\n                            (in z1744 z1727)\n                            (and (@ App z1726 z1744 z1745) (exists z1746 (and (@ Pair z1738 z1740 z1746) (@ Pair g z1746 z1745)))))))\n                            (exists z1747\n                            (exists z1748\n                            (and\n                            (in z1747 z1727)\n                            (and (@ App z1726 z1747 z1748) (exists z1749 (and (@ Pair z1739 z1734 z1749) (@ Pair g z1749 z1748)))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b18d4faf06437\" href=\"?note=e67b18d4faf06437\" title=\"ZFC_Cons\">Cons</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bf7d5deceaf3